  Minimal device-admin policy set. <uses-policies/> is empty on purpose: the receiver only
  has to exist so the tablet can be provisioned as device owner. The kiosk hardening (Lock
  Task Mode, status bar, persistent HOME, permission grants) is applied by KioskController
  through device-owner DevicePolicyManager calls, which use no policy declared here.
-->
<device-admin xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android">
    <uses-policies>
    </uses-policies>
</device-admin>
